From 0fef5141952e5f6227a0e5ab613ca909616b20ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WeiguangTWK <weiguangtwk@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 09:07:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: Zygote: add per-app Scudo compatibility mode

Re-exec selected 64-bit app processes so libc can select Scudo at startup.
Restore required runtime state and system resources across exec.

Change-Id: I77c2b3ac742a461f8d96fc77a757a8dfc3ec21cc
